  "adaptations": [
    "Native vector materials, serif typography, brass rotary rims, forest-green display wells and measured panel positions reproduce the concept's visual language; this is not a pixel-identical raster clone.",
    "The common native header retains discoverable Skins and Full editor actions; its master control and preset controls differ from the concept's exact header arrangement.",
    "All three oscillator previews and all eight macros use real engine state. Algorithm labels remain dynamic rather than displaying the concept's fictitious Hybrid oscillator or fixed wavetable names.",
    "The concept's four envelope tabs are replaced with the actual amplifier and filter envelope controls. LFO editing and advanced modulator views remain available in the Full editor.",
    "The reference's Sub block is replaced by the real ring-modulation 2 × 3 mixer stage, rather than presenting an unsupported independent sub oscillator.",
    "The shared drive control is the real waveshaper drive, not a separate fictional drive stage for each filter. Filter plots are explicitly response previews.",
    "Eight effect selectors are promoted here; all sixteen native effect slots and full parameter editing remain available through Full FX editor. Unused algorithm-specific controls are disabled rather than mapped to unrelated parameters.",
    "The analyzer draws a spectrum and output levels from actual main-output samples; the native scope action remains available for detailed analysis. It does not paint static reference spectrum activity as live audio.",
    "Modulation assignment is handled by the native modulation editor; reference-only fabricated route values and botanical bitmap ornamentation are not copied into the live interface.",
    "Mixer, envelope and selected-effect controls use the concept's label-above/knob/value order. Macro rows and the amplifier velocity knob use measured centres; the additional real filter-envelope row remains an explicit functional adaptation.",
    "The cream surface palette and brass control rims are calibrated from the supplied reference. Oscillator labels now sit above the controls; compact tuning fields preserve the engine tuning binding rather than inventing independent semitone/cents parameters."
  ]
}
